WEBVTT

00:09:28.981 --> 00:09:30.399
(Applause)

00:09:30.441 --> 00:09:32.735
That's what I'm talking about, too, yes.

00:09:32.776 --> 00:09:34.945
Don't give them an allowance.

00:09:34.987 --> 00:09:38.532
Instead, challenge them
to start a business

00:09:38.574 --> 00:09:40.242
to earn their spending money.

00:09:40.242 --> 00:09:42.703
So this is my boys,
and this is one of the ways

00:09:42.745 --> 00:09:44.663
that they've earned money,

00:09:44.705 --> 00:09:47.082
their own spending money,
is they make bracelets.

00:09:47.875 --> 00:09:53.213
And there is no better lesson
around the value of a dollar

00:09:53.255 --> 00:09:57.676
than when you have to work hard
to earn each one of them.

00:09:57.718 --> 00:09:59.595
And through this process,

00:09:59.637 --> 00:10:03.307
our kids will learn confidence,
financial literacy,